<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-Belgian unemployment up to 13.7 pct in July.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belgian unemployment up to 13.7 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Employment Ministry released the following unemployment data -</p>
<p>    BELGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	   July 97    June 97   July 1996</p>
<p>    Total registered jobless (*) 588,184    540,562    598,866</p>
<p>    Total benefit recipients (!) 477,369    456,745    487,790</p>
<p>    Pct of workforce		  13.7	 12.6	 14.0</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) all registered unemployed, whether or not they receive unemployment benefits; (!) excluding those over 55 whom the Office regards as too old for the labour market.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
